@startuml
title Đăng nhập nhân viên và xem hồ sơ
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #222222
  ActorBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ActorBorderColor #222222
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  BoundaryBorderColor #222222
  ControlBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ControlBorderColor #222222
  EntityBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  EntityBorderColor #222222
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  MessageAlign center
}

actor Employee
boundary AdminPortal
control API
control AuthService
entity PostgreSQL

Employee->AdminPortal: Nhập email và mật khẩu
AdminPortal->API: POST /auth/employee/login
API->AuthService: Validate credentials
AuthService->PostgreSQL: SELECT employee by email
PostgreSQL-->AuthService: Employee record
AuthService->AuthService: Compare password hash
AuthService-->API: JWT access token
API-->AdminPortal: 200 token and employee
AdminPortal-->Employee: Hiển thị trang quản trị
Employee->AdminPortal: Mở hồ sơ
AdminPortal->API: GET /auth/employee/profile
API->AuthService: Verify employee JWT
AuthService-->API: Active employee
API-->AdminPortal: 200 profile
@enduml
